# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Paper PDFs are NOT redistributed in this repository.
#
# arXiv's default submission licence ("arXiv.org perpetual, non-exclusive
# license") does not grant third parties redistribution rights. Individual
# papers may be CC-BY, but that has to be checked per paper, so the corpus is
# kept locally and referenced by arXiv ID in research/paper-index.md instead.
#
# To keep a local copy: place PDFs in papers/<category>/ — they stay ignored.
# To publish them anyway (only after checking each licence), delete the two
# lines below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
papers/**/*.pdf
*.pdf

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# Secrets / config
.env
.env.local
*.key

# Experiment outputs
experiments/**/runs/
experiments/**/results/
experiments/**/*.jsonl
!experiments/**/example_*.jsonl
outputs/
logs/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
